<title>USA: Pure World in talks to settle litigation.</title>
<headline>Pure World in talks to settle litigation.</headline>
<dateline>BEDMINSTER, N.J. 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pure World Inc said on Friday it was holding talks to resolve disputes with American Industrial Properties REIT, including the settlement of all pending litigation.</p>
<p>Pure World said American Industrial had cancelled its December annual meeting in anticipation of a settlement.</p>
<p>Pure World filed suit in February seeking the appointment of a receiver for American Industrial, a Texas real estate investment trust.</p>
<p>Pure World owns about 9.785 percent of American Industrial's outstanding shares.</p>
